{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/pulls/503","id":5311280359,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSNzcp88AAAABPJO05w","html_url":"https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/pull/503","diff_url":"https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/pull/503.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/pull/503.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/issues/503","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/pulls/503/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/pulls/503/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/issues/503/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/statuses/b7210db3f53361987fd33592de438fd7984d991a","number":503,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Nextgen: actual English objects, durable Memory/Quiz rounds and native integration","user":{"login":"Ullmann27","id":64243701,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MjQzNzAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64243701?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27","html_url":"https://github.com/Ullmann27","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Current development source\n\nHead: `b7210db3f53361987fd33592de438fd7984d991a`, tree `c65558a13e4dd2950eda7a685583e5484d9b9959`. Native pin: `29080ef8cd1a5b385eeeec97976fbefd31280427`. Main remains unchanged.\n\nThis commit joins the reviewed native worlds to the current Flutter host and fixes a concrete English-learning gap: the native listen action previously requested only its German explanation. It now prepends the trusted visible English object word with the same local F2 voice, a 250-ms gap and the unchanged German explanation in one bounded, cancellable playback request. Existing German Flutter calls, consent gates and child-data paths remain unchanged.\n\n## Production behavior in this draft\n\n- Interactive native geometry for 14 English words, including all 10 grade-1/2 school-supplies entries; hints and wrong choices do not become invented mastery.\n- Native Memory cards and flips driven by the existing Dart dealer, opponent and profile-scoped durable round/reward authority.\n- Native Quiz stage using the existing 20-question session, three jokers, durable ACKs and result persistence.\n- Actual Quiz, Memory and English Android input/save/lifecycle/return probes added after the retained general, learning/Cards and C4 tours on API35 and API37.\n- An exact Host/Native three-activity authority matrix is mandatory before publication. All previous publisher gates remain.\n- Strict speech contracts run after actual Android host compilation using its existing Gradle distribution offline: 11 Java cases and eight Kotlin cases, including the unchanged 23-envelope/17-lifecycle assertions. Missing toolchains, skips and incomplete result rosters fail.\n\n## Current evidence\n\n[Native run 43611803408](https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-godot/actions/runs/43611803408) completed all nine jobs successfully. The unchanged recorder accepted 49 newly reviewed original images, all 5,085 ZIP CRCs and five clean source stamps. The exact archive is 227,270,408 bytes, SHA256 `f9d84c3d4f80f27fe134ab5e4cb040b811262d6d6c6a032433bc5f644ed886fc`. Twenty-one image files are newly added; 28 current captures are byte-identical to already retained files. Every selected current image was actually viewed.\n\n[Current Feature acceptance 43618076296](https://github.com/Ullmann27/lumo-lernen/actions/runs/43618076296) is running. Its source-contract job has already passed: Memory 30 cases / 1,694 checks; scheduler seven cases / 13 checks; Quiz 28 cases / 1,786 checks, all zero skips. Full Flutter and actual Android compile/speech are not yet declared successful.\n\nLocal completed checks: 11 Java cases / 103 assertions using explicit synthetic ONNX boundaries; 19 Python runner boundary cases; four existing current/historical pin tests. All 50 historical pins remain unchanged. The source commit has 39 intended changed files, 4,328 unchanged leaves and 4,367 total leaves; 17 complete UTF-8 readbacks and 22 verified binary create-SHA/local-hash bindings.\n\n## Historical results remain separate\n\nHost2e20 previously passed all three acceptance jobs, the full 2,608-test Flutter suite and 599 script tests. Those are baseline results, not success for this new head. Prior failed Flutter, Native47 and Studio14ca logs remain preserved with their narrow repairs.\n\nThe separate current Native29080 English/Memory/Quiz desktop authority run succeeded against actual Host50503, with 17/15/6 personally reviewed images. The forthcoming Studio matrix reruns these against the exact final candidate Host.\n\n## Remaining acceptance and limits\n\nThe actual installed APK must still pass API35/API37, Creative, C4, the new three activity probes, the 2017 upgrade and all publication gates. Studio remains at its previous unapproved14ca head until these Feature source gates pass.\n\nThe native receipt records simple scenery, compact-label/scroll limits, some character framing limits and four resource-at-exit diagnostics in legacy Kart probes. Its movie is 148 recorded frames at24 fps; no device-FPS, heard-English-audio or phoneme-lip-sync claim follows. No physical Fold7 thermal, latency or60-FPS result exists. This draft does not claim the complete AAA master scope is finished. No Main merge is requested.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-14T12:34:27Z","updated_at":"2026-11-14T17:06:30Z","closed_at":"2026-11-14T17:06:30Z","merged_at":"2026-11-14T17:06:30Z","merge_commit_sha":"b7210db3f53361987fd33592de438fd7984d991a","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Ullmann27:chatgpt/lumo-nextgen-feature-20261114","ref":"chatgpt/lumo-nextgen-feature-20261114","repo":{"id":1222433959,"node_id":"R_kgDOSNzcpw","name":"lumo-lernen","full_name":"Ullmann27/lumo-lernen","owner":{"login":"Ullmann27","id":64243701,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MjQzNzAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64243701?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27","html_url":"https://github.com/Ullmann27","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ullmann27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Lumo Lernen Flutter Android App","homepage":null,"language":"Dart","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"watche